[在Miz Jeannie上阅读完整咒语 →](https://mizjeannie.com/2026/09/red-thread-key-for-holding-a-boundary)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Parchment-style spell infographic showing a small key tied with red thread to a folded paper packet beside salt and an envelope." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ab2b7c6cc930.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 17:15:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>未知符号</title><link>https://some.pics/6ab2911e2fe9c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;未知符号。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A drawing of a symbol on a wall. " height="5654" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/furstenberg/6ab2911e2fe9c.jpg" width="4240"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://furstenberg.some.pics"&gt;@furstenberg&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:31:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>一本标题为“Tintehörnchen”的2027年挂历，饰有黑白墨水动物插画，其中日历页上有一只松鼠；另有几幅较小的印刷画，分别描绘了一只松鼠、一只睡着的狐狸、一头熊和一头驴，它们摆放在木质表面上。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ab28ecd6d0a4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一本标题为“Tintehörnchen”的2027年挂历，饰有黑白墨水动物插画，其中日历页上有一只松鼠；另有几幅较小的印刷画，分别描绘了一只松鼠、一只睡着的狐狸、一头熊和一头驴，它们摆放在木质表面上。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A 2027 wall calendar titled "Tintehörnchen" featuring black and white ink illustrations of animals, including a squirrel on the calendar page and several smaller prints of a squirrel, a sleeping fox, a bear, and a donkey, are arranged on a wooden surface. - Ein Wandkalender für 2027 mit dem Titel "Tintehörnchen", der schwarz-weiße Tuschezeichnungen von Tieren zeigt, darunter ein Eichhörnchen auf der Kalenderseite und mehrere kleinere Drucke von einem Eichhörnchen, einem schlafenden Fuchs, einem Bären und einem Esel, sind auf einer Holzoberfläche arrangiert.' height="5707" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6ab28ecd6d0a4.jpg" width="4280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:21:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>一脸坏笑的朋友</title><link>https://some.pics/6ab25b5f2efb8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个看起来狡黠的朋友&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A rainbow lorikeet eating the flower of a bottle brush tree. It is green with bits of yellow and red with a blue head. Red eyed. It is surrounded by green leaves" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6ab25b5f2efb8.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:41:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>前往地下通道</title><link>https://some.pics/6ab17cf453e2d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;下到地下通道去。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Looking down at the entrance to an underpass. " height="3817" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/furstenberg/6ab17cf453e2d.jpg" width="2862"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://furstenberg.some.pics"&gt;@furstenberg&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 18:52:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在充电站</title><link>https://some.pics/6ab17be4561e0</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在充电站。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A charging station for electric vehicles. " height="3872" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/furstenberg/6ab17be4561e0.jpg" width="2904"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://furstenberg.some.pics"&gt;@furstenberg&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 18:48:08 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>